    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïkur Musa pipö Israel löwïr akïlenchï, “Akwa pipö Israel, atera lasiny kirurutchï löwïr omwowokwa asete. Aneta kegh lasiny arïp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyam ECHOTYON Tororötïncha muma* nko acha ompö kutïng pö Sinay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Melö kyam nyinte muma* nko papotïnecha opïn, wölo kyam nko acha tïkwïl, chete chï sötote asete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kingölonwokwa ECHOTYON tokoch ompö tokoch ompö kutïng kïngetunö ma ori ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyoghyongan osiswechoni kwenunkwa nko ECHOTYON atamuk oporwokwa ngölyontenyi, ompöwölo kyawaghakwa mayanya amelö kyapekwa apusta wölini le kutïng, kïlö nyinte,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ochan ECHOTYON Tororötïngu nyo kyamïtuneninyi koro Misri, ngetunenö koro sekeynön.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
